            "value" : "Ohne Eingabe des korrekten, in dieser Konfigurationsdatei verwendeten Administrator-Passworts kann diese nicht geöffnet werden."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "If you don't grant access to %@, you cannot use such webpages. Last time %@ was running, the webpage with the title '%@' (%@) tried to download a font." : {
      "localizations" : {
